WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.725
When your customers depend on their websites, downtime is more than a technical issue. It is a trust issue.

00:07.065 --> 00:16.790
Support Facility gives web hosts, data centres, internet service providers, and digital agencies the experienced technical team behind the scenes.

00:17.130 --> 00:32.930
From Linux and Windows administration to cPanel, Plesk, DirectAdmin, A W S, OpenStack, security, monitoring, migrations, and disaster recovery—their knowledge spans the infrastructure modern businesses rely on.

00:33.270 --> 00:44.595
More than half of the team holds individual Red Hat, Cisco, or Microsoft certifications, backed by significant experience supporting customers in global markets.

00:44.935 --> 01:01.835
Beyond day-to-day hosting support, Support Facility also provides cloud architecture and management, DevOps and Kubernetes services, cybersecurity assessments, incident response, threat monitoring, and white-label WordPress and WooCommerce development.

01:02.175 --> 01:13.475
The result is flexible white-label support that works like an extension of your own team—through help desk, email, live chat, server management, and twenty-four-seven coverage.

01:13.815 --> 01:24.940
Support Facility. Deep technical knowledge. Real-world experience. Dependable support when it matters most. Delegate and relax at support facility dot com.
